 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Something upbeat and infectious helps it stick, like dead horse or can't stop dancing. Then look no further than main rhythm, a catchy tune you can strum to at stop lights. Or go for something everyone knows, like Uptown Funk where you follow along. You can get it for reasonable if you shop around. You can get it for reasonable if you shop around. Roughly how much would you say it is? Then pick something you like and can dance to, and practice it so it feels natural. A simple verse and chorus count lot at start, and don't fear simple beats yet.",
